it('KERNEL-0156','mechanism','3.4','retypeEdges rekey: moves the ref (role, from) rows, knot rows and vertex roles to to (for a StretchRef the stretch, its ends being the cut vertices), renumbering each entity knots from 0 in chain order; at every vertex where the moved edges meet edges keeping from it first cuts each profile there (cut knots), and at every vertex where they meet edges already carrying to it joins them (§2.2 rule 5); returns both entities new profiles (a scalar where a part has no knots left), which the caller writes into both records in the same edit.',['§3.4 code block comment','§3.4 profile paragraph','§3.3 rule 2 (split before removal)'],'kernel',['§2.2 rule 5'],['@clearRegion preparation','§4.11','§7 edit split/join of ways'],['rekey','cut knot'])
